strata-gitio third-party notices
================================

docs/modules/gitio.md asks that parts of this crate be copied from tgrep
(`generations/git.rs`, `git_index.rs`, `ignore` handling) with provenance
headers. The tgrep sources live outside the repository and were not
available to the builder of this crate, so no tgrep code was copied: the
command builder, index parser, config parser and ignore matcher here are
fresh implementations written from the spec and from git's documented
formats (Documentation/gitformat-index.txt, git-config(1), gitignore(5),
wildmatch semantics). If tgrep code is later substituted for any of them,
add its licence text here.

The config value parser and the wildmatch matcher follow the behaviour of
git (GPL-2.0) as documented and as observed with git 2.54; no git source
code is included.
